SSSSSSSSAAAAAAAAAAAA
ssssssssaaaaaaaaaaaa
@sprite mbs_ots.pix shoulder 0 60
@darkness K 0.9
@light 250 120 30
@sprite mbs_overdub_big.pix edge 204 30 over
@sprite mbs_fx_viewfinder.pix rec 0 0 over
@sprite mbs_ui_badges.pix linear 14 24 over
